items.description:
12-repo platform serving 3M+ monthly users across recruitment and professional skill assessment. Covers main web app, Android/iOS apps, prep modules, secure auth, and university discovery. C#/.NET/JS stack with Azure CI/CD pipelines and 8 years of active commit history. Traction: 2.9M+ registered users; 
14,000+ employers; 
21,600+ educational institutes; 
550+ competitive exam prep tests. 
Clients: Microsoft, Mahindra, HCL, SBI Life, AON-Hewitt. 
Raised $1.88M over 7 rounds. Claimed profitable at peak. 
Acquired (April 2023)
